" Store）部署指南](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/docs/source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md)。"

msgid "##### 5.1.3.1 Deployment on 4 Atlas 800 A3"
msgstr "##### 5.1.3.1 在4个Atlas 800 A3上部署"

msgid ""
