msgid "**API server and tokenizer configurations:**"
msgstr "**API 服务器与 tokenizer 配置：**"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1`: Enables the `fastokens` backend for Hugging Face fast tokenizers to accelerate input tokenization and output detokenization. The `fastokens` package must be installed.\n"
"- `--api-server-count 16`: Starts 16 API server processes for each API-facing `vllm serve` instance to improve frontend concurrency. It is configured on prefill node 0 (p0) and decode node 0 (d0); prefill node 1 (p1) and decode node 1 (d1) remain headless."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_USE_FASTOKENS=1`：为 Hugging Face 快速 tokenizer 启用 `fastokens` 后端，以加速输入 tokenization 和输出 detokenization。必须安装 `fastokens` 包。\n"
"- `--api-server-count 16`：为每个面向 API 的 `vllm serve` 实例启动 16 个 API 服务器进程，以提升前端并发能力。该配置在 prefill 节点 0（p0）和 decode 节点 0（d0）上设置；prefill 节点 1（p1）和 decode 节点 1（d1）保持 headless。"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"41,37\"` / `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / `--nnodes 2` / `--node-rank`: The prefill engine is split as PP2 over the two prefill nodes — the 78 layers are partitioned as `41/37`. `--node-rank` is `0` on prefill node 0 (p0) and `1` on prefill node 1 (p1).\n"
"- `--distributed-executor-backend mp` / `--master-addr` / `--master-port 7060`: PP runs over two nodes with the `mp` executor (no Ray required). `--master-addr` is `$local_ip` on prefill node 0 (p0, PP master) and `$node_p0_ip` on prefill node 1 (p1).\n"
"- `enable_fused_mc2`: Enables the fused `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` operators.\n"
"- `enable_flashcomm1`: Enables FlashComm optimization to reduce communication and computation overhead on prefill nodes.\n"
"- `--enforce-eager`: The prefill side runs in eager mode (the `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph capture is used on the decode side instead).\n"
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1, ...}'`: Minimal MTP speculation during prefill (decode nodes use a higher count, see below).\n"
"- `fuse_muls_add` / `enable_dsa_cp` / `--kv-cache-dtype int8` / `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8`: Mul-Add fusion, DSA context parallelism for long-context prefill, the SFA/LI sparse attention optimizations and the reshape optimization of the C8 quantized model."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"41,37\"` / `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / `--nnodes 2` / `--node-rank`：prefill 引擎以 PP2 形式拆分到两个 prefill 节点上——78 层被划分为 `41/37`。`--node-rank` 在 prefill 节点 0（p0）上为 `0`，在 prefill 节点 1（p1）上为 `1`。\n"
"- `--distributed-executor-backend mp` / `--master-addr` / `--master-port 7060`：PP 使用 `mp` executor 跨两个节点运行（无需 Ray）。`--master-addr` 在 prefill 节点 0（p0，PP master）上为 `$local_ip`，在 prefill 节点 1（p1）上为 `$node_p0_ip`。\n"
"- `enable_fused_mc2`：启用融合的 `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` 算子。\n"
"- `enable_flashcomm1`：启用 FlashComm 优化，以减少 prefill 节点上的通信和计算开销。\n"
"- `--enforce-eager`：prefill 侧以 eager 模式运行（decode 侧则使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图捕获）。\n"
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1, ...}'`：prefill 期间使用最小 MTP 推测（decode 节点使用更高的数量，见下文）。\n"
"- `fuse_muls_add` / `enable_dsa_cp` / `--kv-cache-dtype int8` / `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8`：Mul-Add 融合、面向长上下文 prefill 的 DSA 上下文并行、SFA/LI 稀疏注意力优化以及 C8 量化模型的 reshape 优化。"

msgid ""
"|Sparse SFA C8|A3 (w8a8c8); long-context prefill|`--kv-cache-dtype "
"int8`|Sparse Flash Attention skips unnecessary attention computation of the "
"C8 quantized model, accelerating long-context prefill|Experimental in "
"v0.23.0. On the w8a8c8 weights it can be combined with DCP/context "
"parallelism (as in the reference configs in this document); on the w4a8c8 "
"weights enabling both together has known issues and is not recommended|"
msgstr ""
"|Sparse SFA C8|A3（w8a8c8）；长上下文 prefill|`--kv-cache-dtype int8`|Sparse Flash "
"Attention 跳过 C8 量化模型中不必要的注意力计算，加速长上下文 prefill|在 v0.23.0 中为实验性特性。在 w8a8c8 "
"权重上可与 DCP/上下文并行结合使用（如本文档中的参考配置）；在 w4a8c8 权重上同时启用两者存在已知问题，不推荐使用|"

msgid ""
"|Sparse LI C8|A3 (w8a8c8)|`--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8`|Sparse "
"attention optimization reduces computation of the C8 quantized model, "
"improving throughput|Independent of `--kv-cache-dtype int8`|"
msgstr ""
"|Sparse LI C8|A3（w8a8c8）|`--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype "
"int8`|稀疏注意力优化减少 C8 量化模型的计算量，提升吞吐量|独立于 `--kv-cache-dtype int8`|"

msgid ""
"|Recompute Scheduler|A3 decode nodes|`--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}'`|Recomputes KV cache on prefill nodes when decode KV cache is insufficient, avoiding decode-side OOM and improving throughput|Set to `false` on prefill nodes|\n"
"|Multistream Overlap Shared Expert|A3|`--additional-config '{\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true}'`|Overlaps shared-expert computation on an additional stream, hiding its latency and improving decode performance|Auto-disabled when `enable_fused_mc2=1`|"
msgstr ""
"|Recompute Scheduler|A3 decode 节点|`--additional-config '{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}'`|当 decode KV cache 不足时，在 prefill 节点上重新计算 KV cache，避免 decode 侧 OOM 并提升吞吐量|在 prefill 节点上设置为 `false`|\n"
"|Multistream Overlap Shared Expert|A3|`--additional-config '{\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true}'`|在额外的流上重叠共享专家计算，隐藏其延迟并提升 decode 性能|当 `enable_fused_mc2=1` 时自动禁用|"

msgid ""
